ontrol, preheatable\nTowels\nBed linen\nBlankets & pillows \nIroning station\nHair dryer\nVarious hygiene items\nMineral water\nCoffee machine with coffee\nWashing machine and dryer in the central reception area\nFree parking in front of the house\n\nbedroom\n\nCarpet tiles, suitable for allergy sufferers\nBOX SPRING BED 180 x 200 cm\nLarge closet in the passage\nBedside tables with USB sockets for charging mobile phones\nBedside lamps\nWindow with a view of the nature reserve of the Neandertal\nCurtains with the possibility of complete blackout\n\nbathroom\n\nshower\nVanity\nWC\nSurface heating element with towel dryer\nFirst aid kit (in a bathroom)\n\nliving room\n\nCarpet tiles, suitable for allergy sufferers\nColor scheme in line with USM style\n2 seater sofa with coffee table\nAdditional armchair\nSmart TV with German / international channels and multimedia\nLighting complete with LED, dimmable, color mood adjustable\nWindow with a view of the nature reserve of the Neandertal\n\nWalk-through kitchen\n\nCountertop with sink\nCeramic hob with extractor hood\noven\nmicrowave\nFridge freezer\nCoffee machine with beans\nKettle, egg boiler, toaster, mixer and other kitchen appliances\nCutlery, dishes and glasses\nPots, pans, spices\nOil & vinegar\nDining table\n\nKeyless access via the Nuki app or code entry\nCloakroom with mirror and shelves\n\nPlease be aware that HousingAnywhere is an online booking platform. Therefore exchanging contact details and offering viewings is not possible. If you would like to reserve this accommodation, send me a booking request or a message and please mention your age and occupation. I look forward to meeting you!","facilities":{"allergyFriendly":{"value":"yes"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"no"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"1"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"no"},"flooring":{"value":"wood"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"no"}